17: /** 事务提交后冻结权威快照；网络发送不占领域锁，每连接仅保留一份待发最新快照。 */
18: @Slf4j
19: @Service
20: public class AutomationStream {
21:     private final AutomationService tasks;
22:     private final Map<String, Set<Client>> clients = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
23:     private final ExecutorService senders = Executors.newFixedThreadPool(2, runnable -> {
24:         var thread = new Thread(runnable, "automation-sse-send"); thread.setDaemon(true); return thread;
25:     });
26:     private final ScheduledExecutorService heartbeat = Executors.newSingleThreadScheduledExecutor(runnable -> {
27:         var thread = new Thread(runnable, "automation-sse-heartbeat"); thread.setDaemon(true); return thread;
28:     });
29:     private volatile boolean closing;
30: 
31:     public AutomationStream(AutomationService tasks) {
32:         this.tasks = tasks;
33:         // 心跳与业务变更分离，静默任务不查库，客户端可检测断网及代理丢失的连接。
34:         heartbeat.scheduleWithFixedDelay(() -> clients.values().forEach(set -> set.forEach(Client::pulse)),
35:                 15, 15, TimeUnit.SECONDS);
36:     }
37: 
38:     /** 建连和重连先排入完整快照，不设置两分钟的请求总时长限制。 */
39:     public SseEmitter subscribe(String owner) {
40:         var emitter = new SseEmitter(0L);
41:         var client = new Client(owner, emitter);
42:         emitter.onCompletion(client::remove);
43:         emitter.onTimeout(client::remove);
44:         emitter.onError(error -> client.remove());
45:         synchronized (tasks) {
46:             if (closing) { emitter.complete(); return emitter; }
47:             Snapshot snapshot = tasks.snapshot(owner);
48:             clients.computeIfAbsent(owner, ignored -> ConcurrentHashMap.newKeySet()).add(client);
49:             client.offer(snapshot);
50:         }
51:         return emitter;
52:     }
53: 
54:     /** 已提交写入只负责入队；一个慢客户端不能持有任务调度锁。 */
55:     @TransactionalEventListener
56:     public void changed(TasksChanged event) {
57:         synchronized (tasks) {
58:             var subscribers = clients.getOrDefault(event.ownerId(), Set.of());
59:             if (closing || subscribers.isEmpty()) return;
60:             try {
61:                 Snapshot snapshot = tasks.snapshot(event.ownerId());
62:                 var update = snapshot.withActivityOnly(event.activityOnly());
63:                 subscribers.forEach(client -> client.offer(update));
64:             } catch (RuntimeException error) {
65:                 log.warn("任务快照读取失败，将断开订阅以重新同步：{}", error.getClass().getSimpleName());
66:                 subscribers.forEach(client -> senders.execute(client::complete));
67:             }
68:         }
69:     }
70: 
71:     /** 先停止心跳和发送线程，再在领域锁之外结束连接。 */
72:     @EventListener(ContextClosedEvent.class)
73:     public void close() {
74:         List<Client> active;
75:         synchronized (tasks) {
76:             closing = true;
77:             active = clients.values().stream().flatMap(Set::stream).toList();
78:             clients.clear();
79:         }
80:         heartbeat.shutdownNow(); senders.shutdownNow();
81:         active.forEach(Client::complete);
82:     }
83: 
84:     /** 单连接串行发送，排队时覆盖旧快照以限制慢连接的内存占用。 */
85:     private final class Client {
86:         private final String owner;
87:         private final SseEmitter emitter;
88:         private final AtomicReference<Snapshot> pending = new AtomicReference<>();
89:         private final AtomicBoolean scheduled = new AtomicBoolean();
90:         private final AtomicBoolean pulsePending = new AtomicBoolean();
91:         private volatile boolean removed;
92: 
93:         private Client(String owner, SseEmitter emitter) { this.owner = owner; this.emitter = emitter; }
94:         private void offer(Snapshot snapshot) {
95:             // 覆盖旧快照时保留尚未送达的历史失效信号，不能被下一次纯计时更新吞掉。
96:             pending.updateAndGet(previous -> previous != null && !previous.activityOnly() && snapshot.activityOnly()
97:                     ? snapshot.withActivityOnly(false) : snapshot);
98:             schedule();
99:         }
100:         private void pulse() { pulsePending.set(true); schedule(); }
101:         private void schedule() {
102:             if (removed || closing || !scheduled.compareAndSet(false, true)) return;
103:             try { senders.execute(this::send); }
104:             catch (RejectedExecutionException error) {
105:                 scheduled.set(false);
106:                 if (!closing) log.warn("任务快照发送队列不可用：{}", error.getClass().getSimpleName());
107:             }
108:         }
109:         private void send() {
110:             try {
111:                 if (removed || closing) return;
112:                 Snapshot snapshot = pending.getAndSet(null);
113:                 if (snapshot != null) emitter.send(SseEmitter.event().name("snapshot").data(snapshot));
114:                 else if (pulsePending.getAndSet(false)) emitter.send(SseEmitter.event().name("heartbeat").data("ok"));
115:             } catch (IOException | RuntimeException error) {
116:                 log.debug("任务事件客户端已断开：{}", error.getClass().getSimpleName());
117:                 complete();
118:             } finally {
119:                 scheduled.set(false);
120:                 if (pending.get() != null || pulsePending.get()) schedule();
121:             }
122:         }
123:         private void remove() {
124:             removed = true; pending.set(null); pulsePending.set(false);
125:             var subscribers = clients.get(owner);
126:             if (subscribers != null) subscribers.remove(this);
127:         }
128:         private void complete() { remove(); emitter.complete(); }
129:     }
130: }

